# Git Commit

## Directives

- Inspect the change and commit only work belonging to it.
- Apply the selected issue-tracking policy before choosing a branch or preparing
  the commit.
{{> issue-tracking}}
- Where a branch is required, use `<commit-type>/<issue-id>-<commit-slug>` when
  a tracked issue applies; otherwise use `<commit-type>/<commit-slug>`.

